# Agent permissions (project)

## Allowed without asking the user

- Read and edit application source in this repo.
- Run project-local install, test, and build (npm/pnpm/yarn, docker compose).
- `git status` and `git diff` only.

## Ask the user first (or do not do)

- `git commit`, `git push`, force push, deploy, or any production release.
- Reading `.env` or credential files; use `.env.example` and mock values only.
- Global software installs outside this project.
- Real user PII; use fixtures and mock data only.

## Local data

- Database: Docker Compose Postgres on localhost only, not production.
